Metric:
- id: governance.compliance
- name: 
- description: This metric measures the adherence of data assets and user access to established data governance and access policies within the enterprise data platform. It encompasses the evaluation of data classification, data ownership, and user permissions to ensure that sensitive data is handled according to regulatory and organizational standards. The scope includes all data storage and processing components, as well as the associated ETL/ELT pipelines and orchestration workflows. Typical signals of compliance include documented access controls, audit trails, and policy enforcement mechanisms. Common exclusions may involve data that is not subject to governance policies or assets that are outside the defined governance framework.

