- description: This metric measures the level of engagement with the analytics platform across various departments within the organization. It encompasses active users, which indicates the number of unique individuals utilizing the platform, as well as dashboard views and query activity, reflecting how often users interact with data visualizations and perform data queries. The scope includes all departments that have access to the analytics platform, providing insights into usage patterns and departmental engagement. Common exclusions may involve automated processes or service accounts that do not represent human interaction. By analyzing these components, organizations can assess the effectiveness of their analytics initiatives and identify areas for improvement in user training or platform features.

